{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達董事會只用了12天，就做出撤銷罷免黃仁勳的決定。三年前的同一周，OpenAI撤換山姆・奧特曼，完成同樣的復位只用了不到五天。幾乎沒人預料到黃仁勳復職的消息。周一早晨，就在英偉達發佈官方復職公告的幾分鐘之前，預測市場Polymarket上，押注黃仁勳本月復職的概率僅約3%。公告發佈五分鐘後，該概率飆升至99%。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587702.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:38:02.044555+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":163,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T16:22:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:15.130533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:31:15.130533+00:00","content_hash":"d89eadf436efa216ed84c0321ba7c3de7a22d80ac6b9015f3ee65310f506b21b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}